          "sent_mt": "2026-11-07T17:58:12-07:00",
          "text": "The production line has operated under proper conditions, and checks conducted by the Quality Department have been satisfactory, remaining within established parameters. Constant monitoring of organoleptic properties—specifically taste—is being maintained. Notably, a slight increase in the final weight of the individual pieces was observed, which resulted in a reduction in the number of units per box (236–238 pieces). The operator made the necessary adjustments, successfully stabilizing the weights between 14.1 and 14.7 g and restoring the count to 253–255 pieces per box. This adjustment was effective; the line continues to operate properly, with no outstanding deviations.",
